[[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Move the power steering circuit pipe.</p><p>2. Undo the fixing bolt (2a) and remove the auxiliary drivebelt moving tensioner (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179003818.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Position the tensioner roller and tighten the fixing bolt to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/179000410.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Value - daNm</p></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>2.5</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ENGINE COMPONENT BELT TENSIONER - R.R.</p></td><td><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Apply an appropriate locking compound to the threaded part of the bolts.</p></aside><p>- Position the power steering circuit pipe.</p>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the retaining bolt.</p><p>2. Remove the fixed tensioner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179003820.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the single components belt fixed tensioner and secure it tightening the bolt to torque.</p>"],[4,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the retaining bolt.</p><p>2. Remove the fixed tensioner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179003821.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the single components belt fixed tensioner and secure it tightening the bolt to torque.</p>"],[1,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing bolt (1a) and remove the fixed tensioner (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179003822.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\"